[engl]
{100}{}{Tolya}
{200}{}{You see Tolya, a desert bandit.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Begin}
{1020}{}{over}
{2000}{}{Hello, I am Tolya. Looks like you just wandered in from the desert. Who are you?}
{2010}{}{What do you do?}
{2020}{}{Can you tell me about your camp?}
{2030}{}{Never mind, thanks.}
{3000}{}{As a raider, I explore the lands in search of new supplies. There have been some towns which have been graced by our presence.}
{3010}{}{What places have you been to?}
{3020}{}{In other words, you steal from the people you visit.}
{4000}{}{We never steal. We just take the extra that others have and redistribute it among our hungry people.}
{4010}{}{So, basically, you steal it.}
{4020}{}{That sounds like a really great idea.}
{4030}{}{Uh, yeah. I think I will be going now.}
{5000}{}{You are starting to become annoying now. I think I will end
 that slight problem.}
{5010}{}{Uh, yeah. I think I will be going now.}
{6000}{}{Do not bother me right now. I am preparing for the next raid.}
{7000}{}{I've been to many places in the wastelands. The closest places that I've been to are Shady Sands and Junktown. They are very grateful for the trips we make to them.}
{7010}{}{You visit Shady Sands?}
{7020}{}{Where's Junktown?}
{8000}{}{Yes, we go to Shady Sands from time to time. It adds a little
 excitement to the lives of everyone concerned.}
{8010}{}{Uh, yeah. I think I will be going now.}
{9000}{}{Why, Junktown is just a little bit to the south of here. Go a few miles, turn right at the dying cactus. You can't miss it!}
{9010}{}{Uh, yeah. I think I will be going now.}

